	(text "02 -80 V input, 2.5 V reference, bias DAC (I2C 0x4A, resets to zero scale) and four bias channels: one OPA462 (180 V) per tube on +15 V / -80 V. Vout = 29 x 0.920 x Vdac - 70 V: DAC 0 = -70 V (cold), full scale = -3.3 V. rev_c/PLAN.md."
