	(text "DAC7578 TSSOP-16: power-on reset to zero scale (TSSOP parts, TI). ADDR0 = VDD -> 0x4A (GND 0x48 and float 0x4C; 0x48 / 0x49 / 0x4B are the ADCs). ~LDAC = GND (outputs update on write), ~CLR = VDD (unused). Outputs E-H unused. VREF2V5 also sets the bias offset (Rg) and is read back by ADC3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 241.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
