	(text "Per channel: DAC -> 10k / 115k (k = 0.920; the 115k holds the input at 0 V = cold if the DAC output is high-Z) with 330n (50 Hz); OPA462 non-inverting, Rf / Rg = 280k / 10k to VREF2V5 (0.1 %: sets the cold point -70.0 V); no cap across Rf (sim P1: phase margin 81 deg without it, 48 deg with 1n); 1k / 1u to BIASn (the tube's 91k grid leak, sheet 01). E/D Com = GND, E/D = +5 V (enabled; E/D low would leave the output high-Z). Status flag unused. PowerPAD (pin 9) = V- = -80 V copper. Input CM 0-2.3 V within (V-)+1 .. (V+)-3; supply 95-97 V of 12-180 V; Iq 3.2 / 3.7 mA; about 0.35 W each."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
